1. BruteForce: Time - O(n2), Space - O(1)
    - Iterate over the array, verify if the sum of i-th element + j-th element matches the target.

2. HashMap: Time - O(n), Space - O(n)
    - Check if the difference of current element from the target (i.e. target - element[i]) is available in hashmap(element[], index),
    - Else add the (element, index) to the map after visiting.